{
  "id": "tunnel",
  "title": "How tunnels are built under rivers",
  "lang": "en-gb",
  "voice": {
    "bm_george": 0.6,
    "bm_fable": 0.4
  },
  "leadIn": 0.05,
  "gap": 0.06,
  "tail": 1.4,
  "handle": "@explainland",
  "scene": "tunnel",
  "hook": {
    "line1": "HOW TUNNELS ARE BUILT",
    "line2": "UNDER RIVERS"
  },
  "outro": {
    "line1": "WOULD YOU RIDE IT?",
    "line2": "COMMENT BELOW"
  },
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "There's a train running under this river. How did they build it?",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "trainClose",
      "event": "hook",
      "highlight": [
        "train",
        "under",
        "river"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If you just dig, the river floods in. Instantly.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "floodClose",
      "event": "flood",
      "highlight": [
        "floods",
        "instantly"
      ],
      "hold": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "The ground down there is soaked, like a sponge.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "section",
      "event": "reset",
      "label": "SOAKED SOIL",
      "labelWord": "soaked",
      "labelAt": [
        -3,
        -3.0,
        0.3
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "soaked",
        "sponge"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So first, engineers drill test holes, to know exactly what's down there.",
      "speed": 1.3,
      "shot": "surveyClose",
      "event": "survey",
      "label": "BOREHOLES",
      "labelWord": "test",
      "labelAt": [
        -1.0,
        -1.6,
        0.3
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "test",
        "holes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then they dig a deep shaft on each bank, walled with concrete.",
      "speed": 1.3,
      "shot": "shaft",
      "event": "shafts",
      "label": "LAUNCH SHAFT",
      "labelWord": "shaft",
      "labelAt": [
        -12.5,
        -1.0,
        0.3
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "shaft",
        "concrete"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A crane lowers a giant machine down, piece by piece.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "crane",
      "event": "lower",
      "highlight": [
        "piece"
      ],
      "hold": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "A tunnel boring machine, taller than a four-storey building.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "shaftScale",
      "event": "scale",
      "label": "BORING MACHINE",
      "labelWord": "boring",
      "labelAt": [
        -12.6,
        -2.5,
        0.3
      ],
      "highlight": [
        "four-storey"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Its spinning cutter head grinds through the mud,",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "followTBM",
      "event": "bore",
      "label": "CUTTER HEAD",
      "labelWord": "cutter",
      "labelAt": "tbmFront",
      "highlight": [
        "spinning"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "while a steel shield holds the ground up.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "followTBM",
      "label": "SHIELD",
      "labelWord": "shield",
      "labelAt": "tbmBody",
      "highlight": [
        "shield"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But the river pushes water in, with huge pressure...",
      "speed": 1.2,
      "shot": "faceClose",
      "event": "leak",
      "highlight": [
        "pressure"
      ],
      "hold": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "so the machine pumps thick slurry against the face, pushing back just as hard.",
      "speed": 1.3,
      "shot": "faceClose",
      "event": "counter",
      "label": "SLURRY",
      "labelWord": "slurry",
      "labelAt": "face",
      "highlight": [
        "slurry",
        "back"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The dug-out mud is mixed in, and pumped away through pipes.",
      "speed": 1.3,
      "shot": "pipes",
      "event": "muck",
      "highlight": [
        "pipes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "To move forward, huge jacks push off the last ring.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "tailClose",
      "event": "jacks",
      "label": "THRUST JACKS",
      "labelWord": "jacks",
      "labelAt": "jacks",
      "highlight": [
        "jacks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then a robot arm builds the next ring, segment by segment.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "ringsClose",
      "event": "segments",
      "label": "SEGMENTS",
      "labelWord": "segment",
      "labelAt": "segment",
      "highlight": [
        "segment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Rubber seals and bolts make every joint watertight.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "insideTube",
      "event": "seals",
      "label": "RUBBER SEALS",
      "labelWord": "rubber",
      "labelAt": "segment",
      "highlight": [
        "watertight"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But there's a gap behind each ring. Leave it, and the riverbed sinks.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "gapShot",
      "event": "gap",
      "highlight": [
        "gap",
        "sinks"
      ],
      "hold": 0.3
    },
    {
      "text": "So grout is pumped in to fill it, and the ground stays put.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "groutShot",
      "event": "grout",
      "label": "GROUT",
      "labelWord": "grout",
      "labelAt": "grout",
      "highlight": [
        "grout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And a laser keeps it on course, to within a few centimetres.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "sectionMid",
      "event": "laser",
      "label": "LASER",
      "labelWord": "laser",
      "labelAt": "laser",
      "highlight": [
        "laser",
        "centimetres"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Months later, it breaks through into the far shaft.",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "arrival",
      "event": "breakthrough",
      "highlight": [
        "breaks"
      ],
      "hold": 0.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Then come the rails, lights, fans and drainage pumps...",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "fitClose",
      "event": "fitout",
      "highlight": [
        "rails"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and the trains, right under the river!",
      "speed": 1.25,
      "shot": "trainClose",
      "event": "train",
      "highlight": [
        "under",
        "river"
      ],
      "hold": 0.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Would you ride it? Tell me in the comments.",
      "speed": 1.2,
      "shot": "aerial",
      "event": "final",
      "highlight": [
        "ride",
        "comments"
      ]
    }
  ]
}